Package: dryaddata
Title: Programmatic Access to the Dryad Data Repository
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Alex M", "Chubaty",
           email = "achubaty@for-cast.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7146-8135"))
Description: A modern client for the Dryad (<https://datadryad.org>) REST API
    (version 2). Search and retrieve dataset metadata, list versions and files,
    and download data files or full dataset archives. Authenticated downloads
    use OAuth2 client credentials. Responses and downloaded files are cached
    on disk in a user-configurable location.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/FOR-CAST/dryaddata, https://for-cast.github.io/dryaddata/
